# Your own env/app/ secret field names that are safe to rotate by editing
# the file directly (not backed by state a live service already has - see
# scripts/mystic_auth/env-tools/rotate-secrets/rotate-secrets.sh's own
# header for why POSTGRES_PASSWORD-shaped fields don't qualify).
#
# One FIELD_NAME=LENGTH per line (LENGTH optional, defaults to 40).
# Ships empty; upstream never edits this file again. Copy to
# fields.env (gitignored) next to this file, fill in, then run:
#   scripts/mystic_auth/env-tools/rotate-secrets/rotate-secrets.sh
#
# Example:
#   MY_API_SIGNING_KEY=40
